# Studio Omni Web Frontend — Environment Configuration
# Configured in Vercel Project Settings > Environment Variables

# The base URL of the Studio Omni Express API backend.
# In local development, defaults to '/api' (proxied by Vite to http://localhost:4000).
# For production deployment on Vercel, set to your deployed backend URL:
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://api.studiomni.design/api
VITE_API_URL=/api
